  "description": "Classifies an ICT-related incident as major or not-major under Commission Delegated Regulation (EU) 2024/1772 Art. 8(1): critical services (Art. 6) AND either the Art. 9(5)(b) successful-malicious-access condition or two or more of the other Art. 9(1)-(6) materiality thresholds, with their absolute and relative limbs, Art. 8(2) recurring-incident aggregation, and DORA Art. 18(1)(a)-(f) labels in statutory order. Consumes the 2025/301 clock result from art-467 (art-467 feeds art-09) and marks it binding only on a major determination; a caller-declared clock result of the same shape keeps it usable standalone; an origin mismatch yields not_evaluable stages, never silent precedence. Fast, deterministic.",
